    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.clients.characters.Intro">Every character MultiPreview knows: the ones running now and the ones you set up before. Open a character with › to see all of its settings on one page.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.clients.characters.table.Title">The character list</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.clients.characters.table.Body">- **Hotkey** switches straight to that character. Click it to record a key.&#x0A;- **Show** hides or shows its thumbnail.&#x0A;- **Cycle** leaves it out of the next and previous client keys until MultiPreview restarts.&#x0A;- **›** opens the character's own page.&#x0A;&#x0A;Two characters can share a hotkey: pressing it switches between them.&#x0A;&#x0A;**Add all running clients** keeps your running characters on the list after they log out.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.clients.characters.clicks.Title">Clicking thumbnails</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.clients.characters.clicks.Body">A plain click switches to that client. **Ctrl+click** and **Shift+click** can minimize it or skip it when cycling instead. Ctrl is also EVE's lock-target key, so pick what suits how you play.&#x0A;&#x0A;**Use per-character colours** turns on the border and text colours you set on each character's page.</sys:String>
