    <sys:String x:Key="L.S.StatsPicker.Reset">Use the defaults for every number</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.character.numbers.Title">Choosing single numbers</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.character.numbers.Body">**Choose numbers…** lists every number the stats overlay can show. **Default** follows the list for every character; **Always show** and **Never show** decide for this character only. The group switches above set a whole group at once.</sys:String>
