    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.tools.stats.characters.Title">Numbers per character</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.tools.stats.characters.Body">A character can show different numbers, for example repairs on a logistics alt. The table lists every character; › opens its page at **Choose numbers**.</sys:String>
