    <sys:String x:Key="L.Start.Crash.Body">The last session, started {0}, ended without MultiPreview closing: it crashed, or was stopped by Task Manager or a power cut. If something went wrong, error_log.txt in the logs folder may say what. Attach it to a bug report.</sys:String>
