    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.app.diagnostics.errors.Title">Errors and unexpected closes</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.app.diagnostics.errors.Body">MultiPreview keeps running when something goes wrong, and writes what happened to the **Error log**. While it has handled errors, the tray icon's tooltip says how many.&#x0A;&#x0A;If MultiPreview closed without you closing it (a crash, Task Manager, a power cut), it says so the next time it starts and offers the logs folder.&#x0A;&#x0A;When you report a bug, attach error_log.txt from the logs folder.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Start.Missing.Title">Your settings file is missing</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Start.Missing.Body">MultiPreview can't find your settings file:&#x0A;{0}&#x0A;&#x0A;It is missing, but copies of your settings were found. Pick one to restore.&#x0A;&#x0A;"Start fresh" starts again with default settings, as on a first start. Your backups stay in the Backups folder.&#x0A;&#x0A;If you close this window, MultiPreview uses default settings for this session, saves nothing, and asks again the next time it starts.</sys:String>
