    <sys:String x:Key="L.S.alerts.hub.notifyTest.Desc">Shows one notification right away, so you can see whether Windows lets them through. Its buttons do nothing.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.S.Notify.TestButton">Show a test notification</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.S.Notify.Blocked">Windows is not showing MultiPreview's notifications: they are turned off in Windows' own settings, for all programs or for EVE MultiPreview. Turn them on there (System, then Notifications).</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Notify.TestLine">This is a test. Its buttons do nothing.</sys:String>
