    <sys:String x:Key="L.S.GroupAlerts.ClearAsk">Clear the alert choices of the group “{0}”? Every event follows the switch for everyone again.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.S.GroupAlerts.ClearYes">Clear the choices</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.S.GroupAlerts.ClearNo">Keep the choices</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.S.GroupAlerts.OpenGroups">Open the Groups page</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.S.GroupAlerts.NotKept">That choice was not kept: there is no room for more group choices. Clear choices another group no longer needs, or give this group a shorter name.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.S.GroupAlerts.Note">Own alert choices for {0}: see Alerts for one group, on Alerts › Events.</sys:String>
